                    <td valign="top" width="80%" style="border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-color:#CCCCCC;"> Secondary Copper Smelter and Refinery Unit at Jhagadia, Gujarat ( 50,000 TPA of Copper Cathodes Conforming to LME-A grade ) was acquired</td>
